        "step_number": 4,
        "text": "Step 4: Out of these 6 arrangements, only 2 will result in the segments \\(AB\\) and \\(CD\\) intersecting. These are the arrangements where the points alternate, i.e., \\(A, C, B, D\\) or \\(A, D, B, C\\)."
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 1211,
